Subject: Record the shared observed peer incarnation patch
Why: Quiver uses the same hyper-raft detector as Kiln, including its record of the last accepted peer incarnation.

diff --git a/vendor/patches/hyper-raft/0010-expose-the-observed-peer-incarnation.patch b/vendor/patches/hyper-raft/0010-expose-the-observed-peer-incarnation.patch
new file mode 100644
