+++ b/vendor/patches/hyper-raft/0010-expose-the-observed-peer-incarnation.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,40 @@
+Subject: Expose the observed peer incarnation
+Why: AD-1 binds a quorum of process-loss reports to the same execution-owner incarnation before transferring a session.
+
+diff --git a/crates/hyper-liveness/src/lib.rs b/crates/hyper-liveness/src/lib.rs
